{"server":"tw","storyId":"act38side_level_act38side_04_beg","groupId":"act38side","stageId":"act38side_04","title":"體面來賓","storyCode":"PV-4","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act38side/level_act38side_04_beg.txt","sourceHash":"21fe520530ac363e7152e3270a31f12f7ca87dd058924b5b7af91570c3127f45","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_g1_newvolsiniistreet_d"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"<p=2>1100年11月7日    8:30 A.M.</>"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警察","speakerId":"avg_npc_1553_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉維妮婭法官，那個沃爾珀剛剛在這片區域被目擊到過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警察","speakerId":"avg_npc_1553_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她很敏銳，幾乎一天換一個住所。我們調查了她這段時間去過的所有地方，才鎖定了她的大致位置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……“英格麗·威尼斯”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當年還在法律學校讀書時，教授法理學的老師曾經提到過這個名字，我昨晚一時間竟然沒有想起來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她當時說，敘拉古殘忍與爭鬥的氣質並非來自常居於此的種族，而是源於這片土地本身……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以溫順的沃爾珀來到敘拉古後，也會被浸染成“比狼更狠的沃爾珀”——我們的法律便是要約束這種必然的演化。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警察","speakerId":"avg_npc_1553_1","isRemote":false,"text":"英格麗曾在五座移動城市的法院留下了二十餘份卷宗，每一份都對應著威尼斯家族在當地勢力的迅速擴張……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警察","speakerId":"avg_npc_1553_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而家族也總是會想盡辦法幫她從仇殺和審判中脫身。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警察","speakerId":"avg_npc_1553_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有傳言說，在家族內部，她甚至比老威尼斯的親生女兒更得他喜歡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警察","speakerId":"avg_npc_1553_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但在1094年，英格麗突然離開了家族。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"離開？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警察","speakerId":"avg_npc_1553_1","isRemote":false,"text":"準確地說，是叛逃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警察","speakerId":"avg_npc_1553_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當時威尼斯家族的載具公司進駐特爾尼城，唐克雷蒂家族為了搶奪當地的合金資源主動挑釁，衝突愈演愈烈，最終訴諸暴力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警察","speakerId":"avg_npc_1553_1","isRemote":false,"text":"同在灰廳的兩大家族鬥得不可開交，老威尼斯本人在當時都遭到了暗殺……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警察","speakerId":"avg_npc_1553_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那段時間，英格麗展開了對唐克雷蒂家族高層的襲殺，連續犯下了十多起命案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警察","speakerId":"avg_npc_1553_1","isRemote":false,"text":"詭異的是，當西西里夫人親自下場，雙方終於能夠坐下來談判時，英格麗卻罔顧家主的命令，並未停下自己的行動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警察","speakerId":"avg_npc_1553_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看過當時的記錄，她所使用的手段……令人膽寒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原因？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警察","speakerId":"avg_npc_1553_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不明。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警察","speakerId":"avg_npc_1553_1","isRemote":false,"text":"總之英格麗的行為無異於公然挑釁西西里夫人的權威，而她本人卻在犯案後銷聲匿跡……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警察","speakerId":"avg_npc_1553_1","isRemote":false,"text":"整個威尼斯家族都被遷怒，差點重蹈德克薩斯家族的覆轍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"narration","text":"年輕的法官想像著那個沃爾珀女性在城市中殺人如麻的樣子，以及昨天在酒莊裡，她嘴角始終掛著的微笑。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警察","speakerId":"avg_npc_1553_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉維妮婭法官？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一個身負血案、叛逃出家族的頂尖殺手，突然出現在新沃爾西尼……又恰逢狂歡節期間。不能放任她自由行動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警察","speakerId":"avg_npc_1553_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您的意思是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"已經進駐新沃爾西尼的家族都接受過背景審查，每一個成員、每一件武器都被登記在冊，接受嚴格管控……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"英格麗這樣的人，無論是否出自她的本意，她都極有可能成為某些人手裡的刀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管怎麼樣，先控制住她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警察","speakerId":"avg_npc_1553_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是。但……這片區域很大，我們還做不到準確定位她的位置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果關於她和她女兒的情報無誤，我很確定她一定會去一個地方。"},{"type":"narration","text":"拉維妮婭看向了不遠處一塊不起眼的招牌——“羅德島辦事處”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_offce"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程部幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，因為狂歡節，我常去採購材料的那家店今天也要開始休假了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程部幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"得提前在終端上把辦事處的物資儲備狀況更新一下了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程部幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伺夜幹員的狀況如何？本艦調派來支援的醫生去了醫院之後到現在都沒有消息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療部幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道。這次本艦支援行動的保密等級很高，我的權限不夠，無法查詢伺夜幹員最新的監測數據。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療部幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我去找過斥罪小姐，她似乎也並不想透露太多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程部幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"相信同事吧。我們只需要完成相關的後勤保障任務就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療部幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦……PRTS更新了公告，“核准提高新沃爾西尼辦事處警備等級的申請”，發起人是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療部幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"斥罪小姐？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子月","speakerId":"avg_4014_lunacu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡也有羅德島的安全屋……看來羅德島的人就像牙獸一樣，會為自己挖很多個巢穴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子月","speakerId":"avg_4014_lunacu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼呼……不要驚擾其他人，把握時間恢復體力——"},{"type":"narration","text":"“咕——”\n子月縮在天花板與通風管道之間，有些無奈地按了按自己扁扁的肚子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子月","speakerId":"avg_4014_lunacu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……還有甜甜的、蜜糖的味道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子月","speakerId":"avg_4014_lunacu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不行，得打起精神。趁有時間，我要把手裡的箭打磨得更鋒利一點——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子月","speakerId":"avg_4014_lunacu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可以先去吃飯？阿涅塞，但之前你不是教我，狩獵的過程中要有耐心——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子月","speakerId":"avg_4014_lunacu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子月","speakerId":"avg_4014_lunacu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不想要阿涅塞輸，我的肚子可以等。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子月","speakerId":"avg_4014_lunacu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就是這樣，其他事我會聽阿涅塞的，但是這件事，我不想讓阿涅塞失望。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"子月縮在角落裡，近乎本能地握緊了手中的弓，瞄準。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子月","speakerId":"avg_4014_lunacu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（不是狼，是阿涅塞也討厭的味道。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的鼻子沒那麼靈，分不清你是哪一個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我知道你們中有一個躲在這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我給你十秒的時間，離開這個地方，我會在外面等你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，要繞開羅德島的人解決你也非難事，只是得冒點風險罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，給我個機會，我試著不讓麗薩的同事們留下壞印象。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子月","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來是沒得談了——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"反應這麼快？有意思。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"我建議各位把武器先卸下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"我們已經封鎖了離開的通路，防禦系統也全部啟動了，不要讓事情變得更難看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子月","speakerId":"avg_4014_lunacu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡是你們為我設下的陷阱？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"呃……陷阱？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"這是我們的警備系統在正常運作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……羅德島真是從來不讓人失望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"女士，我可以保證，我們只是為了保護自己的財產安全。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"請兩位耐心等待，政府馬上會來接手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子月","speakerId":"avg_4014_lunacu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（阿涅塞，有沒有好辦法能離開？阿涅塞？阿涅塞……你在哪裡？）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們又見面了，英格麗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"未經登記註冊，在新沃爾西尼城內私自動用致命武器，並造成了城內合法公司的財產損失。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這次你必須得和我走一趟，接受調查了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……她呢？"},{"type":"narration","text":"英格麗指了指那個仍然警惕地觀察著周圍情況的少女。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，我們會帶她一起回去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子月","speakerId":"avg_4014_lunacu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿涅塞需要我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子月","speakerId":"avg_4014_lunacu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的狩獵還沒結束——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“咕——”\n在場的人都不約而同地偏開了頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們會為你準備食物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子月","speakerId":"avg_4014_lunacu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"英格麗女士，請吧，我不希望讓警察動手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想保護她？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是我們需要考慮的事情了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，我和你們走。只是出於尊重你，拉維妮婭。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_g1_newvolsiniistreet_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"政府職員","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉維妮婭法官，她們的預先登記都已經完成。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"政府職員","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"後續的操作不會很複雜的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我說過我會很配合。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……萊昂向我說起過那個遊戲。你和她一樣？"},{"type":"narration","text":"拉維妮婭的視線看向了一旁的子月。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子月","speakerId":"avg_4014_lunacu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，謝謝你們的蜜餅。"},{"type":"narration","text":"子月把嘴裏的食物盡力吞嚥下去，眼睛卻一直掃視著周圍的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子月","speakerId":"avg_4014_lunacu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我能走了嗎？我還有重要的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我並非獠牙，拉維妮婭。我說過，我只是來為自己的孩子討一個公道的母親。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子月","speakerId":"avg_4014_lunacu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不准碰我的弓！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"政府職員","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……法官，真的不用把她控制起來嗎，萬一——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心，我心裡有數。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"子月，你還記得我嗎？不要試圖貿然行動，周圍已經被警察包圍起來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"留在我身邊，對我們都好。你可以相信我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子月","speakerId":"avg_4014_lunacu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只相信阿涅塞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"貝納爾多也相信我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子月","speakerId":"avg_4014_lunacu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……他死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但他的子嗣還活著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子月","speakerId":"avg_4014_lunacu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我、我想問問阿涅塞。但從剛才起，阿涅塞就不再回應我了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"安心待在我身邊，你能避開很多麻煩，也有足夠的時間聯絡那位阿涅塞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子月","speakerId":"avg_4014_lunacu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"narration","text":"英格麗安靜地站在原地看著拉維妮婭勸說子月。\n看著身上充滿荒野氣息的少女在不斷猶豫時，英格麗便知道機會越來越近了。\n要是拉維妮婭能控制住阿涅塞的獠牙，她會省去很多麻煩。\n她相信，另一個躲藏起來的獠牙一定會自己找上門來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如果你提前聯絡了我，目前這些誤會還有很多更體面的解決辦法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好久不見，姐姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"安東尼奧先生。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您好，拉維妮婭法官。我是特意來為英格麗·威尼斯遞交登記所需的身分資料和企業證明的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐，這件事大可放心交給我。我們與政府之間一直保持著良好的合作關係。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"法官小姐，我知道英格麗最近的舉動有違反新沃爾西尼規定的地方，但是否還未有非常嚴重的過錯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓我盤點一下，未登記註冊、公共場所私自動用武器，哦，對了，還有損壞合法公司財物，對嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"關於最後這一項，威尼斯載具公司會儘快與該公司商討好賠償事宜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"安東尼奧先生，你大可直言你想要做什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"保釋。帶我的姐姐回家，家裡人都很想她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，安東尼奧，我不想把家族牽扯進來。你們也沒有必要為了我和市政廳鬧僵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這不光是為了你，姐姐，也是為了我們家族著想。無論你自己怎麼認為，爸爸和我都依舊視你為家族的一員。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不希望家裡有人在新沃爾西尼背上不光彩的案底。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"況且，不必在這對“家族”這個詞諱莫如深，我們都清楚這是我們生活的根基所在。新沃爾西尼所要的，無非也是一個表態。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原諒我如此坦誠，拉維妮婭法官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我理解，威尼斯載具公司能長期和我們合作良好，本來就依賴雙方的坦誠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但安東尼奧先生，你確定要用整個企業的聲譽來為英格麗擔保嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有何不可？即便是對老家主，我也是同樣的回答。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"威尼斯載具公司可以向政府保證，保釋期間，我們會確保英格麗·威尼斯不會違反法律。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你們找到了明確的證據證明她有罪，我會親自陪同她去庭審現場。"},{"type":"narration","text":"拉維妮婭很頭痛，對方的所有要求都符合正規流程。\n英格麗的確享有被保釋的權利，但……不該是現在。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒辦法拒絕不是嗎？安東尼奧先生，你的確很會和政府打交道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為我確信您並非死板的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟我能看出來，您認識旁邊拿著那張顯眼大弓的朋友，也並沒有因為她的動手而和她過不去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子月","speakerId":"avg_4014_lunacu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐，我們走吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"保釋的手續會有其他人替你處理。我清楚你為何回到敘拉古，麗薩的事，我們能幫上忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"威尼斯……這件事和你們也有關嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌張的政府職員","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌張的政府職員","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剛、剛剛不知道從哪裡竄出來一隻牙獸咬了我一口！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"牙獸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等——子月呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌張的政府職員","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她就在旁——"},{"type":"narration","text":"職員突然愣住了，她的旁邊空無一人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌張的政府職員","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷靜的警察","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"大法官，我們剛剛和一個行動很敏捷的人交了手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷靜的警察","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"她嘴裡喃喃著荒野的技巧和阿涅塞什麼的，完全沒攔住……其他同事已經追上去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_g3_newvolsiniialley_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說真的，姐姐，我還以為在家族考慮將業務拓展到東國之前，我們不會再有見面的機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別這麼稱呼我，安東尼奧。我們沒那麼親近，而且我已經不屬於家族了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看他們對你的態度，下一任家主應該就是你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你越來越像老爺了——不光是行事的氣魄，連外形都是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這耳朵和尾巴……是你娶了貝拉之後兩個人越長越像了，還是你偷偷在上面花了不少心思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"英格麗，你怎麼還是這樣……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不喜歡別人開你玩笑，但自己說話又不饒人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好久不見，英格麗，我和爸爸都很想你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爸爸收養了你，親手將你撫養長大，我加入家族的時候，你已經是他最信任的人了。他對你的疼愛，一點都不輸對親生女兒貝拉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而一個從玻利瓦爾逃難來的傢伙，為了不餓死來當打手，他誰都不認識，不得不夾著尾巴做人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真論打架的本事，在狼群裡，他比其他人強不了多少，憑什麼在這麼大的家族立足呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管你是出於沃爾珀對一個佩洛的恻隱之心，還是作為家主最信任的成員需要安撫手下人……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"總之當年要不是你處處幫我，我早就死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老爺這一生在乎的東西很多，但體面無論如何都是放在第一位的，他絕不會允許家族內部的人互相排擠和傾軋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"英格麗，我不是說這個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我必須要成為“小威尼斯”，不然我會覺得愧疚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"六年前，在特爾尼城，我們和唐克雷蒂家族打得不可開交的那天，是你把我從死人堆裡拖了出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那不是為了你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唐克雷蒂家族策劃刺殺老爺的計劃傷害了麗薩，那時她才九歲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無論策劃了那起襲擊的人是誰，他都應該去死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我知道，我只認事實，你救了我的命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你和老爺都有更在意的事情需要處理，這些客套話大可不必。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我剛到新沃爾西尼打聽消息時，酒吧裡那些傢伙還在吹噓你們的成績呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“安東尼奧陪著老威尼斯求見西西里夫人，獨自坐上談判桌，儘管對方趁機發難，但還是替威尼斯家族在特爾尼城保下了一間工廠。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看看現在，你已經得到了你想要的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"本來在那個位置上的應該是你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你卻一意孤行，逃出了敘拉古。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我心裡，你雖然是沃爾珀，卻比任何人都更像一個敘拉古人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我始終記得我第一次跟著你出任務，在小巷裡遭到埋伏，你的臉被刀劃傷，鮮血淋漓，我想送你去醫院……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你說，對手認為我們已經死了，現在正是他們的老巢最不會設防的時候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“要狠一點，佩洛。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“身在敘拉古，身在家族，每一天都在刀口舔血，失去什麼都不稀奇。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“如果沒這個覺悟，就趕快滾回玻利瓦爾。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你一直做得比我們所有人都好，你一直是我學習的對象。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以哪怕你因為一趟旅行就和那個我們直到現在連面都還沒見過的東國佬結了婚，哪怕你突然帶回了麗薩，我也不以為意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別誤會，我當然愛那個孩子，爸爸和貝拉也愛那個孩子……我們為她安排了最好的房間、最好的老師，我們像愛你一樣愛她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爸爸那時候常說，那個孩子只會讓你強大，而不會成為你的軟肋——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夠了安東，別囉嗦了。很煩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是回來陪你緬懷過去的。當年到底是誰傷害了麗薩，說吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你就這麼急迫，不想見到爸爸之後再談這些？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回來幫我，英格麗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麗薩的事，本就是家族欠你的，我一定會幫你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不想和家族再扯上關係，這樣對我們都好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽我說，英格麗，我們好不容易在新沃爾西尼紮穩了根基。一座新的城市，一套新的秩序，有太多事情需要去做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爸爸的年紀大了，這幾年也沒什麼值得期待的年輕人。你知道他的性格，他不願意改變，但更不願意看著家族落後於人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"加上貝拉的死，對他和我的打擊都很大——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"貝拉已經死了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去年的事。她的身體一直不好，你知道的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很需要你，英格麗……而且我想，爸爸比我更希望你能回來。"},{"type":"narration","text":"英格麗沉默著，只是冷淡地看著眼前的這位佩洛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……回來，麗薩受傷的真相我會告訴你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來我們沒什麼好說了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至於你自作主張把我從拉維妮婭那帶出來，多謝，但並無必要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有自己的計劃。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"英格麗揮了揮手，轉身便要離開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"英格麗，從你第一天到新沃爾西尼時，我就知道你回來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"家族從來沒有忘記你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有，我看見你懷裡藏得很好的家徽了，你也沒有自己說的那麼坦然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"家族的大門永遠向你敞開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……你已經是一個敘拉古人了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我以此為榮。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_g3_newvolsiniialley_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"等等，英格麗，這裡有一個消息你可能會很感興趣。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我認得你們，之前你們跟在安東尼奧的身邊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我剛才已經和他說得很清楚了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是盧奇諾·德蒙塔諾的下落。我們抓了他，然後把他帶回了威尼斯家族在新沃爾西尼的地盤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們沒辦法帶你去見他，但能告訴你具體的位置。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼要出賣自己的主人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有，為什麼你們會知道翁貝托拜託我的事情？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃……我沒辦法解釋清楚！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，這傢伙他的確沒騙你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"*敘拉古粗口*，有人逼我們把這個消息告訴你，我們也不知道那個小裁縫和你有什麼關係，我們也只是為了活命！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"活命？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果不說清楚，你們還是沒辦法活命。"},{"type":"narration","text":"英格麗很瞭解自己的刀。她懂得用刀，知道什麼時候真能致命，什麼時候能讓刀下之人以為自己的刀能致命。\n可惜卡彭和甘比諾並不知道，此時的情況是後者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"無趣，我還以為你會真的下手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你真是個瘋子！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他的脖子很強壯，你可能要用點力才能砍得動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……拉普蘭德·薩盧佐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，你認得我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們見過一面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你長大了很多，但你這個笑容，我記得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"見過嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不記得了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"十年前，布魯奈羅城，我作為中間人，前去調停你們薩盧佐家族與莫雷蒂家族的紛爭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那時你才十幾歲，明明家族已經在苦鬥中落入下風，明明是備受阿爾貝托期待的繼承人，你想要做的事情卻是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"趁機為整個家族送葬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，那時候年少輕狂嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人都會成長的。對現在的我來說——整個敘拉古，都是我的敵人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瘋子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你一邊微笑一邊給出這個評價，看來沒多真心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼告訴我這個消息，薩盧佐家族和威尼斯家族在這座城市有利益衝突？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩盧佐的死活關我什麼事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是那個小裁縫還欠我兩套禮服，見到他之後，麻煩替我催催他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓客人久等是不禮貌的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我會自己去確認。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有就是，你是個很沒意思的敘拉古人，但是個很有意思的母親。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原來傳話對你們來說也是件艱巨的任務。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算你要我們替你做事，也至少讓我再去和老闆說一聲，我不想被威尼斯家族追著跑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你還想要我們做什麼，拉普蘭德？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，你們看起來可沒那麼情願嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心，我沒興趣從那隻佩洛手裡搶人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們就乖乖待在他身邊就好，必要的時候幫剛才那個人一把。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，作為獎賞，我會告訴你們，你們一直在找的那輛失蹤的卡車在哪裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你到底想要幹嘛？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想要你們在小威尼斯面前立功啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這不是你們應得的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"甘比諾，我有預感，我們這次是真的死定了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……是啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
